      "title": "packet-cql.c: implement few auth related message dissection",
      "message": "packet-cql.c: implement few auth related message dissection\n\nCQL_OPCODE_AUTH_RESPONSE, CQL_OPCODE_AUTHENTICATE, CQL_OPCODE_AUTH_CHALLENGE, CQL_OPCODE_AUTH_SUCCESS\ngot a bit of dissection. It's incomplete, in the sense that we could dive into the SASL dissection - if it's being used, but it's a start.\n\nSigned-off-by: Yaniv Kaul <yaniv.kaul@scylladb.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Yaniv Kaul",
      "author_email": "yaniv.kaul@scylladb.com",
